SUMMARY:Meet the Maker: Jefferson's Bourbon | Session II 
LOCATION:Scottie's
DESCRIPTION:Category: Food & Beverage\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 1 spot le
 ft\nStatus: You are on Waitlist\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.c
 om/events/206917\n\nJoin us for an intimate tasting experience with Jeffer
 son’s Bourbon\, exploring the craftsmanship\, character\, and creativity
  behind each pour. The evening begins with a welcome cocktail and time to 
 mingle before a guided tasting led by Jefferson’s founder Trey Zoeller. 
 A Kentucky native with deep family ties to American whiskey\, Zoeller foun
 ded Jefferson’s with his father in 1997 and has become known for challen
 ging bourbon tradition through inventive approaches to aging and blending\
 , earning him a place in the Kentucky Bourbon Hall of Fame.\n\nAs straight
  tasting pours are passed\, Trey will share the story of Jefferson’s whi
 le guiding members through the flavor profiles\, production process\, and 
 distinctive character of each selection. Following the tasting\, the eveni
 ng opens back up for conversation\, giving members the opportunity to ming
 le\, revisit their favorites\, and connect with Trey one-on-one for questi
 ons and a deeper dive into the world of Jefferson’s Bourbon.\n\n*This ev
 ent is complimentary and reserved for members only. Complimentary light bi
 tes and refreshments will be served. We kindly ask that all cancellations 
 be made at least 24 hours prior to the start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/206917
CATEGORIES:Food & Beverage
